{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Pepper Poppers is a ",["l","烹饪","cooked dish"],". It is prepared using either the kitchen inside an upgraded ",["l","农舍","farmhouse"]," or a ",["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"],"."]],["p",["The ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," trades 2 Pepper Poppers for 1 ",["l","星露谷年历","Stardew Valley Almanac"],". It may also randomly appear in ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],"' shop on ",["l","周循环#Saturday","Saturdays"],", in the ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"]," outside the saloon, or in ",["l","星之果实酒吧","the Stardrop Saloon"],"'s rotating stock. ",["l","谢恩","Shane"]," may occasionally send the player Pepper Poppers in the mail as a gift. He also sells up to 3 sets of 3 Pepper Poppers in his ",["l","沙漠节#Villager Shops","shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 30 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s each. One can sometimes be purchased at the ",["l","星露谷展览会","Stardew Valley Fair"]," for 250 Prize Tickets. One Pepper Poppers may be received from opening a ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Pepper Poppers are not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Pepper Poppers are used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["f","Shirt180.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Tunnelers Jersey"],". It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as an orange dye at the dye pots located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],". It can also be used as a brown dye when used in the spool of the Sewing Machine with a dyeable clothing item in the feed."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["Pepper Poppers are not used in any ",["l","任务","quests"],"."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.02","1.02"],": The recipe now requires cheese."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Can now be prepared using a ",["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"],". Now sometimes sold at the ",["l","星露谷展览会","Stardew Valley Fair"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Can now trade 1 ",["l","星露谷年历","Stardew Valley Almanac"]," for 2 Pepper Poppers at the ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"],". Can now be purchased at ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],"."]]]]]]]}